{"organizations": [], "uuid": "9cd3132ab07479a0483dc704b2034ee8c69328f2", "thread": {"social": {"gplus": {"shares": 0}, "pinterest": {"shares": 0}, "vk": {"shares": 0}, "linkedin": {"shares": 0}, "facebook": {"likes": 3, "shares": 1, "comments": 0}, "stumbledupon": {"shares": 0}}, "site_full": "sina.com.hk", "main_image": "https://rs3.sinahk.net/cap/3/2018/12/22/c/c0c43174a4e47cf77d9c75811548c1e1.jpg", "site_section": "", "section_title": "", "url": "https://sina.com.hk/news/article/20181222/0/0/2/Apple%E8%82%A1%E5%83%B9%E9%99%8D%E8%87%B352%E5%91%A8%E6%9C%80%E4%BD%8E%E7%9A%84149%E7%BE%8E%E5%85%83-%E5%87%BA%E7%8F%BE%E6%AD%BB%E4%BA%A1%E4%BA%A4%E5%8F%89-9566562.html", "country": "HK", "domain_rank": 18498, "title": "Apple股價降至52周最低的149美元 出現“死亡交叉” - 香港新浪", "performance_score": 0, "site": "sina.com.hk", "participants_count": 0, "title_full": "", "spam_score": 0.0, "site_type": "news", "published": "2018-12-22T02:00:00.000+02:00", "replies_count": 0, "uuid": "9cd3132ab07479a0483dc704b2034ee8c69328f2"}, "author": "", "url": "https://sina.com.hk/news/article/20181222/0/0/2/Apple%E8%82%A1%E5%83%B9%E9%99%8D%E8%87%B352%E5%91%A8%E6%9C%80%E4%BD%8E%E7%9A%84149%E7%BE%8E%E5%85%83-%E5%87%BA%E7%8F%BE%E6%AD%BB%E4%BA%A1%E4%BA%A4%E5%8F%89-9566562.html", "ord_in_thread": 0, "title": "Apple股價降至52周最低的149美元 出現“死亡交叉” - 香港新浪", "locations": [], "entities": {"persons": [], "locations": [], "organizations": []}, "highlightText": "", "language": "chineset", "persons": [], "text": "2018年12月22日 09:31\n來源：cnbeta\n隨著整個美股大盤走低，Apple股票（AAPL）昨日收盤前也創下 52 周新低，降至 149 美元每股。正如分析師所指出的，在過去幾個月裡 AAPL 股價下跌已使其陷入死亡交叉領域。按照專業定義，所謂死亡交叉指的是下降中的短期移動平均線由上而下穿過下降的長期移動平均線，這個時候支撐線被向下突破，表示股價將繼續下落，行情看跌。\n藍線期貨總裁 Bill Baruch 向 CNBC 表示，Apple股票比他預期要低得多，現在認為很可能會低至 144 美元每股。「我認為下行可能達到 144 美元，有可能到不了那裡，但你必須計劃到最壞的情況。」\n四個月前，Apple還是首個突破萬億美元市值的上市公司，到現在股價已經下跌了 36%，市值只有 7160 億美元，幾個月內市值損失接近 3000 億美元。 關注我們Facebook專頁 ", "external_links": [], "published": "2018-12-22T02:00:00.000+02:00", "crawled": "2018-12-22T09:29:31.033+02:00", "highlightTitle": ""}